  this function returns the value of the n-th order polynomial

  `p(x) = coeffs[n-1] + coeffs[n-2] * x + ...  + coeffs[0] * x**(n-1)`

  evaluated using Horner's method, i.e.

  ```python
  p(x) = coeffs[n-1] + x * (coeffs[n-2] + ... + x * (coeffs[1] + x * coeffs[0]))
  ```

